    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Attack</strong> invites you to assemble your squad of sci-fi machines for intense PvP action! Lead robots, tanks, and hovers, each equipped with powerful weapons and unique abilities. Strategically combine these units to dominate the battlefield in a dynamic, evolving environment where every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBINE CLASSES AND ABILITIES IN YOUR ULTIMATE SQUAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having different classes of battle machines, each with unique abilities, enhances your tactical variety. Use area-of-effect attacks, block escape routes, go invisible for surprise strikes, or sneak fast with a turbo engine to accomplish the objective and lead your machines to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR WEAPON COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons designed for different vehicle classes to gain strategic advantages. Use homing weapons to bypass obstacles, ballistic weapons for long-range shots, and rotary cannons for quick, heavy damage. Each weapon can be upgraded for improved effectiveness and versatility. Upgrading your machines and weapons creates powerful combinations and various playstyles to help you adapt and succeed in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER EVER-SHIFTING BATTLEFIELDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage opponents on maps where positioning is key. Each map features dynamic elements that can shift battle outcomes, from changing landscapes to AI-controlled bosses, ensuring every encounter tests your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACTIONS FIGHTING FOR EARTH\u2019S FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three factions, each representing a distinct playstyle: the <strong>Bastion</strong>, with high HP and defensive abilities for a defensive approach; the <strong>Hermits</strong>, designed for aggressive gameplay with powerful damage output; and the <strong>Empyreals</strong>, who reshape the battlefield through obstacles, spatial manipulation, and flying maneuvers for a scientific edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/254528cacc5b0e5e772749f3bb23bfb3.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Armor Attack</strong> invites you to assemble your squad of sci-fi machines for intense PvP action! Lead robots, tanks, and hovers, each equipped with powerful weapons and unique abilities. Strategically combine these units to dominate the battlefield in a dynamic, evolving environment where every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBINE CLASSES AND ABILITIES IN YOUR ULTIMATE SQUAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having different classes of battle machines, each with unique abilities, enhances your tactical variety. Use area-of-effect attacks, block escape routes, go invisible for surprise strikes, or sneak fast with a turbo engine to accomplish the objective and lead your machines to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/5a4fc1f69f343a4de2337d6cf46915ac.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER YOUR WEAPON COMBINATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons designed for different vehicle classes to gain strategic advantages. Use homing weapons to bypass obstacles, ballistic weapons for long-range shots, and rotary cannons for quick, heavy damage. Each weapon can be upgraded for improved effectiveness and versatility. Upgrading your machines and weapons creates powerful combinations and various playstyles to help you adapt and succeed in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONQUER EVER-SHIFTING BATTLEFIELDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage opponents on maps where positioning is key. Each map features dynamic elements that can shift battle outcomes, from changing landscapes to AI-controlled bosses, ensuring every encounter tests your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/77a444a8716189eb09e9e708bf1193a0.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACTIONS FIGHTING FOR EARTH\u2019S FUTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between three factions, each representing a distinct playstyle: the <strong>Bastion</strong>, with high HP and defensive abilities for a defensive approach; the <strong>Hermits</strong>, designed for aggressive gameplay with powerful damage output; and the <strong>Empyreals</strong>, who reshape the battlefield through obstacles, spatial manipulation, and flying maneuvers for a scientific edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.poster.avif?t=1746038437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.webm?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2403250/extras/48c0ce57ca423cdef774be0a856ae6b8.mp4?t=1746038437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
